{"id":12440,"date":"2025-03-18T13:37:33","date_gmt":"2025-03-18T13:37:33","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/?p=12440"},"modified":"2025-03-18T13:39:06","modified_gmt":"2025-03-18T13:39:06","slug":"objevte-fascinujici-svet-2d-materialu","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/objevte-fascinujici-svet-2d-materialu\/","title":{"rendered":"Objevte fascinuj\u00edc\u00ed sv\u011bt 2D materi\u00e1l\u016f"},"content":{"rendered":"<p data-start=\"86\" data-end=\"524\">Dvourozm\u011brn\u00e9 materi\u00e1ly, jako je grafen, p\u0159echodov\u00e9 kovov\u00e9 dichalkogenidy (TMDs) nebo hexagon\u00e1ln\u00ed nitrid borit\u00fd (hBN), pat\u0159\u00ed mezi nejv\u00edce fascinuj\u00edc\u00ed oblasti modern\u00ed v\u011bdy. D\u00edky sv\u00fdm jedine\u010dn\u00fdm elektrick\u00fdm, optick\u00fdm a mechanick\u00fdm vlastnostem otev\u00edraj\u00ed dve\u0159e nov\u00fdm technologi\u00edm v kvantov\u00fdch po\u010d\u00edta\u010d\u00edch, optoelektronice a ukl\u00e1d\u00e1n\u00ed energie. Abychom v\u0161ak mohli jejich potenci\u00e1l naplno vyu\u017e\u00edt, je kl\u00ed\u010dov\u00e9 m\u00edt k dispozici p\u0159esn\u00e9 analytick\u00e9 metody.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"526\" data-end=\"1096\">Pr\u00e1v\u011b zde se uplat\u0148uje SNOM mikroskop <a href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/produkt\/cryo-neascopexs\/\"><strong data-start=\"549\" data-end=\"569\">cryo-neaSCOPE+XS:<\/strong><\/a> n\u00e1stroj, kter\u00fd p\u0159in\u00e1\u0161\u00ed nanometrov\u00e9 zobrazov\u00e1n\u00ed v \u0161irok\u00e9m spektr\u00e1ln\u00edm rozsahu od viditeln\u00e9 oblasti p\u0159es infra\u010derven\u00e9 a\u017e po terahertzov\u00e9 z\u00e1\u0159en\u00ed. D\u00edky \u0159e\u0161en\u00ed pro kryogenn\u00ed m\u011b\u0159en\u00ed umo\u017e\u0148uje studium materi\u00e1l\u016f p\u0159i teplot\u00e1ch a\u017e 4 K, co\u017e je nezbytn\u00e9 pro zkoum\u00e1n\u00ed kvantov\u00fdch jev\u016f, supravodivosti a f\u00e1zov\u00fdch p\u0159echod\u016f. Pokro\u010dil\u00e9 spektroskopick\u00e9 mo\u017enosti pak dovoluj\u00ed hyperspektr\u00e1ln\u00ed zobrazov\u00e1n\u00ed a detailn\u00ed anal\u00fdzu lok\u00e1ln\u00edch optick\u00fdch odezev \u2013 to v\u0161e p\u0159isp\u00edv\u00e1 k hlub\u0161\u00edmu porozum\u011bn\u00ed plazmonick\u00fdm a exitonov\u00fdm jev\u016fm v 2D polovodi\u010d\u00edch.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"1098\" data-end=\"1216\">Konference <strong>A<\/strong><strong data-start=\"1103\" data-end=\"1144\">ttocube 2D Materials Conference 2024<\/strong> p\u0159inesla \u0159adu inspirativn\u00edch p\u0159\u00edsp\u011bvk\u016f, kter\u00e9 si nyn\u00ed m\u016f\u017eete p\u0159ehr\u00e1t:<\/p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong data-start=\"2\" data-end=\"74\" data-is-only-node=\"\">Zobrazov\u00e1n\u00ed optick\u00fdch kvazi\u010d\u00e1stic v 2D materi\u00e1lech<\/strong><\/span><\/p>\n<p><em data-start=\"1285\" data-end=\"1327\">William Wilson (Harvard University, USA)<\/em> p\u0159edstavil pokro\u010dil\u00e9 v\u00fdzkumy v oblasti nanov\u011bdy a kvantov\u00fdch technologi\u00ed. Pomoc\u00ed scan-probe technik vizualizoval slo\u017eit\u00e9 jevy, jako jsou polaritony a korelovan\u00e9 elektronov\u00e9 syst\u00e9my, a uk\u00e1zal inovativn\u00ed vyu\u017eit\u00ed t\u011bchto metod v interdisciplin\u00e1rn\u00edm v\u00fdzkumu.<br data-start=\"1582\" data-end=\"1585\" \/><a href=\"https:\/\/marketing.attocube.com\/acton\/ct\/4434\/s-022a-2503\/Bct\/q-0267\/l-unified-contacts:2461\/ct8_1\/1\/lu?sid=TV2%3Aw3xbDcZ2r\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"1585\" data-end=\"1607\">\u27a1 Sledujte z\u00e1znam zde<\/a><\/p>\n<p data-start=\"1611\" data-end=\"1931\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Kryogenn\u00ed s-SNOM studie topologick\u00fdch izol\u00e1tor\u016f a 2D materi\u00e1l\u016f<\/strong><\/span><br data-start=\"1683\" data-end=\"1686\" \/><em data-start=\"1686\" data-end=\"1733\">Jessica Boland (University of Manchester, UK)<\/em> demonstrovala mo\u017enosti kryogenn\u00edho s-SNOM v oblasti topologick\u00fdch izol\u00e1tor\u016f a terahertzov\u00fdch za\u0159\u00edzen\u00ed. P\u0159inesla tak\u00e9 zaj\u00edmav\u00e9 v\u00fdsledky v\u00fdzkumu 2D materi\u00e1l\u016f a nanostruktur.<br data-start=\"1904\" data-end=\"1907\" \/><a href=\"https:\/\/marketing.attocube.com\/acton\/ct\/4434\/s-022a-2503\/Bct\/q-0267\/l-unified-contacts:2461\/ct9_1\/1\/lu?sid=TV2%3Aw3xbDcZ2r\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"1907\" data-end=\"1929\">\u27a1 Sledujte z\u00e1znam zde<\/a><\/p>\n<p data-start=\"1933\" data-end=\"2319\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Kryogenn\u00ed fotoproudov\u00e1 nanoskopie zkroucen\u00e9ho grafenu<\/strong><\/span><br data-start=\"1992\" data-end=\"1995\" \/><em data-start=\"1995\" data-end=\"2038\">Frank Koppens (ICFO Castelldefels, Spain)<\/em> uk\u00e1zal vyu\u017eit\u00ed kryogenn\u00edho s-SNOM k v\u00fdzkumu zkroucen\u00fdch 2D materi\u00e1l\u016f jako kvantov\u00fdch simula\u010dn\u00edch platforem. Pomoc\u00ed fototermoelektrick\u00e9 nanoskopie mapoval \u00fahly zkroucen\u00ed a zkoumal interak\u010dn\u00ed efekty, supravodivost a kolektivn\u00ed excitace v moir\u00e9 struktur\u00e1ch.<br data-start=\"2292\" data-end=\"2295\" \/><a href=\"https:\/\/marketing.attocube.com\/acton\/ct\/4434\/s-022a-2503\/Bct\/q-0267\/l-unified-contacts:2461\/ct10_1\/1\/lu?sid=TV2%3Aw3xbDcZ2r\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"2295\" data-end=\"2317\">\u27a1 Sledujte z\u00e1znam zde<\/a><\/p>\n<p data-start=\"2321\" data-end=\"2492\"><strong data-start=\"2324\" data-end=\"2395\">Nechte se inspirovat nejnov\u011bj\u0161\u00edmi objevy a posu\u0148te sv\u016fj v\u00fdzkum d\u00e1l!<\/strong><\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Dvourozm\u011brn\u00e9 materi\u00e1ly, jako je grafen, p\u0159echodov\u00e9 kovov\u00e9 dichalkogenidy (TMDs) nebo hexagon\u00e1ln\u00ed nitrid borit\u00fd (hBN), pat\u0159\u00ed mezi nejv\u00edce fascinuj\u00edc\u00ed oblasti modern\u00ed v\u011bdy. D\u00edky sv\u00fdm jedine\u010dn\u00fdm elektrick\u00fdm, optick\u00fdm a